Window 1: [1, 12, -5, -6]  → sum = 2
Window 2: [12, -5, -6, 50] → sum = 51  ← slide: +50, -1
Window 3: [-5, -6, 50,  3] → sum = 42  ← slide: +3, -12

maxSum = 51, average = 51/4 = 12.75
```

