### Problem 2.1: Single Number
**LeetCode #136 — Easy**

> Every element appears twice except one. Find the single one. O(1) space.

**Why this problem:** The purest XOR application.

```typescript
function singleNumber(nums: number[]): number {
    let result = 0;
    for (const num of nums) {
        result ^= num;
